    "section": "Why balance matters",
    "page": 1,
    "updatedAt": "2026-08-11T09:00:00.000Z",
    "content": "Self-balancing trees such as AVL trees maintain structural constraints so search, insertion, and deletion remain logarithmic in the number of stored elements."
